{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: While this game provides a tutorial on how to play, it will not hold your hand: come up with your strategies and things that work for you, and think about what you (don't) want to do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turnout</strong>\u00a0was primarily inspired by great games like <strong>Five Nights at Freddy's</strong> and <strong>FLATHEAD</strong>.<br>The game will require you to be focused and quick with your actions and thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The train won't stop and can't be stopped. You don't really have that much time left. Someone's going to end up being on the wrong track.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PICK A NUMBER,\u00a0ADJUST THE ROUTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The server will pick a number, you and your opponent will have to guess it, closest player's pick wins, and their route adjustment will be accepted.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rely on your luck or use the information provided to you to come up with strategies (for a lack of the former).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COUNTER VIRUS ATTACKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Random virus attacks might end your game early if you don\u2019t pay enough attention to them.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNSTABLE VOLTAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frequent power outages will leave you in limbo temporarily - better be quick with your actions.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS FROM THE DEPTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An &lt;entity&gt; tries to join the game to remove one of the players - don't be that player.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049020?t=1772967524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049020?t=1772967524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049020/81e52dc65efe3767e97bc5e6414198f374be57cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772967524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049020/81e52dc65efe3767e97bc5e6414198f374be57cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772967524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],